irmed that  namor was in fact going to be a pretty  big part of black panther 2. and  recently we've had some pretty big  reports that say atlantis and the  atlanteans are going to be in the  eternals movie  specifically the sinking of atlantis so  plans for neymar to appear in the mcu  have already begun  now if marvel's plans were to introduce  namor in black panther 2  obviously they have to switch those up  just a little bit now it's going to be  shuri as black panther that possibly  takes on namor and the atlanteans but as  far as retconning the story goes it  shouldn't be too hard as atlantis and  wakanda have a pretty big history with  each other  but according to this report from grace  randolph this is what marvel studios is  currently discussing  for black panther 2. if this is true  it's a very  interesting route to go so i want to  know what you think about this would you  be  okay with black panther dying in black  panther 2  off screen and then shuri become the new  black panther  be sure to let me know what you think in  the comments down below don't forget to  subscribe so you can stay up to date on  all things relating to the mcu and for  my future giveaways please  like the video if you enjoyed it and for  live updates you can always follow me on  instagram and twitter  as always thank you all so much for  watching woof
 

